Planetary textures (CC BY 4.0)
  Directory: textures/
  Source: "Solar System Scope Texture Pack" by Gregor Skale / Solar System Scope
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
  https://www.solarsystemscope.com/textures/
  Attribution required when you redistribute or publicly display these files.
  Provenance, verified by SHA-256 against the live upstream:
    textures/<name>            ( 9 files, 2k)  byte-identical to upstream 2k_*
            (mercury, venus_surface, mars, jupiter, saturn, uranus, neptune,
             moon, saturn_ring_alpha.png)
    textures/8k_<name>.jpg     ( 7 files, 8k)  byte-identical to upstream 8k_*
    textures/4k_<name>.jpg     ( 9 files, 4k)  NOT an upstream file: Solar System
            Scope publishes no 4k tier. These are downscales of the 8k files
            (reproducible with `sips -Z 4096`), and remain CC BY 4.0 derivative
            works of the upstream 8k images.
  Two upstream quirks, encoded deliberately in main.js: uranus/neptune exist only
  at 2k, and upstream's 8k_jupiter.jpg / 8k_saturn.jpg are actually 4096px images
  (4k under an 8k filename), so 8k aliases to 4k for those two planets.
  Note: four (4) Earth maps are NOT from Solar System Scope (they are among the
  13 unprefixed files listed above):
    textures/earth_daymap.jpg     <- three.js examples (MIT), file
                                     examples/textures/planets/earth_atmos_2048.jpg
    textures/earth_normal.jpg     <- three.js examples (MIT), file
                                     examples/textures/planets/earth_normal_2048.jpg
    textures/earth_specular.jpg   <- three.js examples (MIT), file
                                     examples/textures/planets/earth_specular_2048.jpg
    textures/earth_clouds.jpg     <- three.js examples (MIT), file
                                     examples/textures/planets/earth_clouds_1024.png
                                     (PNG data; the .jpg extension is inherited
                                     from the original project layout)
  The 8k_* files are not committed to this repository (about 68 MB); run
  scripts/fetch-textures.sh to download and verify them.
